      "side": 1,
      "message": "What are the optimizations that this enables? I thought we were going to be able to always include the input attachment even if it wasn\u0027t used so we wouldn\u0027t have to have duplicate pipelines for a non-dst-read draw being included in a renderpass that had other dst-read-requiring draws.\n\nIf it enables optimizations that affect other logic, but don\u0027t change how the pipeline is compiled, then we shouldn\u0027t put it in the pipeline key.",
      "range": {
